  "worked_solution": "Both the first and the third logarithmic terms have a base of $10$ and an argument of $5.$ Therefore, we can combine them by adding their coefficients.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\operatorname{log}⁡(5)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(20)-2\\operatorname{log}⁡(5) & =(4-2)\\operatorname{log}⁡(5)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(20) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{log}⁡(5)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(20)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
